---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | CivicConnect" description="Read the terms governing your use of CivicConnect.">
  <div class="container section max-w-3xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="badge badge-soft mb-3" data-tone="primary">Terms of Use</span>
      <h1 class="text-h1 mb-4">
        Terms of Service. <span class="text-muted-foreground">Guidelines for using the platform.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-small text-muted-foreground">Effective Date: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-small leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground">
        Welcome to CivicConnect. By accessing this website or using our assistant services, you agree to comply with the following Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          These terms govern your access to the CivicConnect assistant, directories, and statutory explorer pages. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of the platform.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">2. Permitted Use License</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          You are granted a revocable, non-exclusive license to query the platform and read summary details for personal, educational, civic, or research purposes. You may not scrape, frame, or automate abusive queries designed to degrade the platform.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          The application codebase, frontend styles, algorithms, and interface layouts are property of CivicConnect contributors. All statutory legislative acts, gazettes, constitutional provisions, and government scheme documents remain public domain or property of their respective government authorities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">4. Disclaimer of Legal Warranty</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          CIVICCONNECT IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. WE DISCLAIM ANY LIABILITY FOR ERRORS, OMISSIONS, OR ACTIONS TAKEN BY USERS BASED ON AI-GENERATED ANSWERS. USERS MUST ALWAYS CROSS-CHECK STATUTORY DEADLINES OR SCHEME CLAIMS WITH OFFICIAL LEGAL COUNSEL OR RELEVANT GOVERNMENT DEPARTMENTS.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
